[PrintTextModified Text:吃完了一如既往的晚餐，<br>艾玛、雪莉、汉娜、梅露露四人走出了食堂。|#0101Adv20_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:10 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:35 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:65 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:90 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:她们走在路上，讨论要不要去冲澡。<br>这时背后有人喊住了她们。|#0101Adv20_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:请问可以打扰一下吗？|#0101Adv20_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们回头一看，原来是奈叶香。<br>奈叶香一直都是独来独往，从未跟随团体一起行动过。|#0101Adv20_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的行动充满谜团。<br>艾玛她们四个不禁有些紧张。|#0101Adv20_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:什么事？你有什么烦恼吗？|#0101Adv20_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:装饰在会客厅里的弩枪不见了。<br>我猜是有人把它拿走了。|#0101Adv20_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [bgm Bgm_026_001_Loop]
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_26_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Fearful1,ArmR4
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:什么……这事很严重欸！？|#0101Adv20_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜脸色煞白，<br>艾玛也产生了不好的预感，心跳越来越快。|#0101Adv20_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（为什么要把弩枪拿走……？）|#0101Adv20_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:去、去确认一下吧。|#0101Adv20_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [back 5]
; ========================================

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_2

[PrintTextModified Text:她们五人<br>陆续进入了会客厅。|#0101Adv20_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:8,0 Zoom:0.6 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:然后她们看到，<br>本该挂在墙壁上的弩枪不见了。|#0101Adv20_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:是真的……什么时候开始不见的……？|#0101Adv20_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:昨天白天来的时候还在，今天来的时候就不见了。<br>所以我猜是昨晚不见的。|#0101Adv20_Nanoka003| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且……昨天还有另一件东西不见了。|#0101Adv20_Nanoka004| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是什么不见了？|#0101Adv20_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是我的发带。我以为是弄丢了，<br>可有头绪的地方我都找过了，还是没找到。|#0101Adv20_Nanoka005| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香嘴上用平淡的口吻描述着事实，<br>但手里却是紧握着拳头，并且微微颤抖着。|#0101Adv20_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（啊，白天我有看见奈叶香。难道说……<br>　她当时是在找那条发带吗）|#0101Adv20_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（奈叶香应该相当珍惜那条发带……<br>　她现在看起来很焦急）|#0101Adv20_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:囚犯里有小偷，<br>我不会放过她。|#0101Adv20_Nanoka006| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:眼神昏暗的奈叶香作出宣言。<br>这句话让艾玛感到脊背发凉。|#0101Adv20_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（她说的不会放过，究竟要做什么……？）|#0101Adv20_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:接着，<br>奈叶香便转身离开了会客厅。|#0101Adv20_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香小姐她不太对劲。<br>我很担心她……|#0101Adv20_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她这副样子，很容易惹出事欸。|#0101Adv20_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:令人在意……<br>我们快跟上去吧！|#0101Adv20_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

