[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们跟着奈叶香后面，<br>看见她走进二楼的娱乐室。|#0101Adv20_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:11_1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们也急忙跟着进去了。<br>果不其然，她和别人起了争执。|#0101Adv20_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [bgm Bgm_025_001_Loop]
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_25_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:你搞什么，见人就说别人是小偷！？<br>开什么玩笑啊你！|#0101Adv20_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我没在开玩笑。所有人之中你看起来最可疑。|#0101Adv20_Nanoka007| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我才想说你呢，你那把枪是搞什么鬼！？是从哪里弄到手的！？<br>最可疑的是你才对！！|#0101Adv20_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙眼看着就要<br>伸出手来抓住奈叶香。|#0101Adv20_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR1,ArmL1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:75 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛慌忙站在她们两人中间，想要从中说和。|#0101Adv20_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你们两个等一下！<br>冷静一下！|#0101Adv20_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:吵死了！滚一边去！|#0101Adv20_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

