; [sfx 26：がしゃんと物が散らばる音]
; ========================================

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_26 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙踢了一脚旁边的西洋棋桌，<br>害棋子撒得满地都是。|#0101Adv20_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:接着她推开了艾玛，抓住了奈叶香的衣领。<br>二人在近距离互相瞪着对方。|#0101Adv20_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:55 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL7
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:你总是在虚张声势，从来没想过认真直面其他人。|#0101Adv20_Nanoka008| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText


[PrintTextModified Text:你说够没……|#0101Adv20_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙高举起的拳头正在颤抖。<br>互殴一触即发，现场的气氛十分紧张。|#0101Adv20_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:哇哇、哇哇哇……|#0101Adv20_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不好啦，要发生暴力事件了！|#0101Adv20_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR18,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，雪莉来到艾玛身边，<br>悄悄在她耳边说道。|#0101Adv20_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要怎么办？我倒是可以阻止她们两个。<br>要我把她们两个打晕吗？|#0101Adv20_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:对于雪莉的危险建议，艾玛她——|#0101Adv20_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

