# Choice1-1-7

@RecordCorrectChoice Number:7

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛用力摇了摇头。|#0101Adv20_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:那样会变成大混战啦。|#0101Adv20_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要是真的打起来了，说不定会违反不能惹事的规定，<br>被关进惩罚室的。|#0101Adv20_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:——你们两个快住手，不要再闹了。|#0101Adv20_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛平静地说道。<br>这时，亚里沙和奈叶香似乎一时间想到了什么，心生怯意，<br>然后各自拉开了距离。|#0101Adv20_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，艾玛，你还挺厉害的。|#0101Adv20_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:在不远处，玛格小声笑了起来。|#0101Adv20_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她好像一开始就在娱乐室里面了。<br>现在她坐在沙发上，摆出一副当旁观者当到底的态度。|#0101Adv20_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我不知道有什么东西被偷了，<br>可是，这座监牢没有一样东西是自己的吧？|#0101Adv20_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我倒是认为，不管是谁拿走了什么东西都无所谓哦？|#0101Adv20_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香尖锐的眼神<br>转移到了玛格身上。|#0101Adv20_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:你也拿了不少东西到自己的房间里。<br>是你偷了我的发带也不奇怪。|#0101Adv20_Nanoka009| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR6,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:发带？没见过呢。<br>不过，如果是很漂亮的东西，说不定我会把它占为己有哦。|#0101Adv20_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:现在马上还给我。|#0101Adv20_Nanoka010| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:不是我干的，或许啦。呵呵。|#0101Adv20_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:快还我。|#0101Adv20_Nanoka011| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（真头大……）|#0101Adv20_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这次换玛格和奈叶香针锋相对，<br>害得艾玛头疼了起来。|#0101Adv20_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

